WEBVTT

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.310
Miss Ruri, we have an emergency situation!
It's Miss Aoi!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.240
Miss... Miss Ruri!

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.800
Aoi!

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:35.360
For the locus of point P, calculate the equation,

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.860
4(x-2)squared <i>+</i> 4(y-3)squared = 1.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.530
What happened to Ruri and Kagami?

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.040
Tandoji, do you know anything?

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.330
Nah, I haven't heard anything.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.920
They seemed just fine yesterday.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:51.040
I don't know about Ruri,

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.750
but Kagami doesn't seem to be the type
that would catch a cold.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:59.840
If it had to do with the Dark Stones,
I know they'd contact me immediately, but...

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.390
Ruri, what's going on?

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:10.810
Um...

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.790
It happened this morning.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:30.330
The stone that was encapsulating my elder sister, Aoi...
it suddenly shattered.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.000
Is she... conscious?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.920
She does show signs of life.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:41.340
But her brain waves and heartbeat are faltering,
and she's still in a deep coma.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.430
So only the stone around her is gone.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.680
Why would that happen?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:47.930
Most likely resonance
of the Sacred Seven, oni.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:49.060
Resonance?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.440
Tandoji, it's you!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:56.900
At the last battle you showed us a power
that we hadn't seen before,

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:04.450
that intense Sacred power resonated and caused
some changes with the slumbering Aoi, oni.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.950
Aoi is just like Ruri, she also has
the power of the Sacred, oni.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.960
Alma, do you feel anything?

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.630
Even the slightest sensation?

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.760
Please!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.800
Please... for Aoi!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.510
Um, but...

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.890
Please!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.640
I'm sorry, I don't...

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.650
...feel anything.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:43.910
I'm sorry for asking you to come over here
and getting so emotional.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:47.530
No, I totally understand.
It's normal to have expectations.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.500
But I'm afraid I couldn't
be of any help.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.830
Sorry.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.090
Um, can I ask you something?

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:01.920
What is it?

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.640
What happened, five years ago?

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:23.570
It might be best if I knew what happened
to your family five years ago.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.700
I understand if you don't
want to talk about it.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.870
I'll tell you.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.090
5 YEARS AGO

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.560
Dad! Here, for you.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:53.350
What?

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.730
The tippy-top. It has to be
on the very top.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:59.610
I see, Aoi, you're pretty set on this.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:04.400
But, but! The star has to be on the very top,
or else it doesn't look pretty. Right, Ruri?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:05.780
What?

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:07.570
The star has to be
on the very top, right?

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:09.820
Um, yeah!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:15.710
Ladies, preparations for the
mini-tree lights are complete.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:18.580
Oh, it's here, it's here!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.590
I guess it must be done.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.920
Hmm, which one should it be?

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.380
It's so beautiful.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.760
Dad, put this one on too!

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.130
Geez.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:33.430
You're all traveling to the vacation home
on Christmas Eve, correct?

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.430
So, why such extravagant decorations--?

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:36.890
Tone it down, Makoto.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.480
You just don't get it,
Kagami Junior.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:45.570
Of course we're going to the lodge on the night
of Christmas Eve to enjoy all the snow.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:49.780
But, that's different than this. You get it?

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:52.830
To a commoner like me,
it's hardly understandable.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:54.620
You smart-aleck!

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:57.160
I'm sorry. I'm still learning.

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:07.510
Ruri, did you tell Santa
what you want for Christmas?

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:08.430
Yup.

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.930
Ruri and Aoi, you both were
good girls this year.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.850
So Santa will bring whatever it is
you wished for.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:18.480
Mom and Dad, we're too old
to believe in Santa Claus.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:23.770
How can you say that!
Santa will come this year, too.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.820
Of course he will.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:28.950
Geez. You'll be that Santa,
Kagami, right?

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:30.700
I know it's you.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:36.120
Aoi, you were thinking really hard
about what to ask Santa.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.160
I was just doing what
you were doing.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.170
Well, you're all together.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.750
Getting ready for Christmas?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:48.170
You're here earlier than
our appointment, Mr. Kenmi.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.510
Oh, sorry about that.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.180
I can't get it together.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.680
Ruri, how's it going for you?

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.100
Ruri?

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.730
Miss Ruri, how about
if I help you?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:08.900
I can do it myself.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.900
Leave her be.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:15.120
Once she decides to do something by herself,
she won't lend an ear to anyone.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.080
She's always like that.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.790
Homework, anything, she's so serious.

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:27.920
But, Mom and Dad seem
to like her that way, you know.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.550
Right, that's the best present ever.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:34.510
You know, it seems like
you don't mean what you say.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.600
Anyway, why are you
still standing up?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.680
For a person of my status,
being in the same position is--

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:43.230
If you wrangle too much, you'll never
become an excellent butler like Kagami.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.110
My father is my father,
I'm my own person.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:49.360
Whatever. You should say that
once you've made it.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.190
Yes, it's connected.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.070
See, an angel!

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:58.700
It's going to be a great Christmas!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:00.620
I wonder if it'll snow this year.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.080
The lodge has already been covered by it.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.540
That doesn't mean anything
unless it snows on Christmas Eve.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.880
Oh, the holly leaf.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.090
In the reception room, right?

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.680
But there's a guest in there now.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:21.220
As the head of Aiba, I can no longer
contribute further funds to your research.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:29.440
But Mr. Aiba, once we complete this project we'll have
a greater understanding of the power your daughters hold.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:36.070
We've supported you
because of my daughters.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.160
But...

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.120
Your conduct goes against humanity.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:44.750
Your evil ways will not be tolerated!

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:51.340
I've heard what you have to say.
Let's talk further at a later date.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.800
Have a fun Christmas everyone.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.940
Hey, where's your stuff?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:17.160
What, it's already time?

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:21.120
Hurry up. It's going to be
the best Christmas Eve ever.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.080
I know!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:28.370
Miss Aoi, Miss Ruri,
it's about time to leave.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:30.210
Oh, my overnight bag.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:33.800
Get a move on! I'll take care of this.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:42.890
Miss?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.520
Where are the girls?

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.190
Makoto went to get them.

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:55.860
Oh, this can be fixed. I can do it.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:11:01.070
It's not like it's completely broken.
I'll just stick them together.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:10.040
Oh, the angel might not make it,
but I can fix the rest before we leave.

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:13.130
No.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:17.550
Well then, what should we do?
It's a present for Mom and Dad!

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:18.220
Shush.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.090
Oh here! I'll do it.

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:20.890
No.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:21.760
Ruri!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:24.140
It won't do!

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.350
It's no good without the angel.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:31.150
Everything needs to be in place
for it to become our Christmas wreath.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.360
That's how we made it!
We made it right!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:38.070
But it's broken, we have no choice.
Here let me do it.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:39.150
No!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:40.490
Ladies!

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:41.990
Dummy...

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.120
You dummy!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:07.430
When things boil over like this,
we have to wait.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.020
Give her some time.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:13.980
Ruri's well behaved,
but she's stubborn too.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:16.610
Let's not dwell on it, OK?

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:22.110
We'll go on ahead to the lodge.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:26.370
Once Miss Ruri is ready,
you can take her over.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.160
By myself?

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:32.000
You need to make it
on your own soon.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.500
You have to do your duty
as a butler of the Aiba family.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:39.210
Or do you think you can't
do it by yourself?

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:43.680
E-Easy enough. You don't
have to worry about me.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.090
That's my boy.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:55.020
Um, Miss Ruri.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:02.280
Well, uh... excuse me.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:16.580
Welcome, welcome! We're glad
you made it from so far away.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.710
The fireplace is lit for you.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.670
Oh, that's great.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:21.670
Thank you.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:31.560
Leave it.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.190
As you wish.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:44.360
Mr. Aiba, we have enough gas
in stock for the home generator.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:49.660
Great. It's such a fun event,
we should prepare everything properly. Yes.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.790
You're always so worried.

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.710
Aw, am I?

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.050
What's that?

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.180
A Christmas present from the boss.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:14.060
Wow, we wouldn't expect any less.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:17.560
How about we shut down for the night?

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:20.570
If we can convince Mr. Kagami.

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.590
Um, should I turn on the lights?

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:49.260
No.

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:57.100
I wonder what everyone is doing.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:06.860
What should I do? I called Aoi
a dummy! What should I do?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:17.540
What should I do, I couldn't tell her
I was sorry. It's all my fault.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:22.460
Don't worry. She'll be back
to herself soon.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.420
Hands... off...!

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:32.470
I don't know what you are,
but the commotion stops here.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:36.810
The ladies are looking forward
to Santa tonight.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:04.170
What a great job.
Everyone is going to enjoy it.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.670
Thanks!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:18.520
Ma'am, what should we do
about dinner?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.890
Mr. Aiba wants to wait for Miss Ruri.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:22.270
Then, should we--

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.530
We're really late.

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:40.540
I have to apologize,
to everyone.

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:04.560
Is this under Kenmi's orders?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.780
Aoi, Ruri, I'm so sorry.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:13.740
I made a mistake. So!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.620
Dad!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:20.370
Run Aoi, get away!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:39.930
It's going to be alright.
Miss Aoi will forgive you.

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:41.680
Really?

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.690
Is this because...

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:56.360
You came here looking
for Miss Ruri?

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:59.950
If that's the case, you'll never get
what you're after.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:08.880
Mr. Aiba, I'm so sorry.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:22.770
Father?

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:25.690
Father, hold on! Father!

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.400
Makoto...?

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:31.520
What's going on, father?
What happened here?

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.820
Well done.

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:38.700
You brought Miss Ruri here, safely.

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:40.830
Father?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.040
A monster...

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.450
A monster?

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:49.000
...appeared. They will keep appearing.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:53.090
I was unable to protect the family.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.090
Makoto, you must protect them!

00:18:57.050 --> 00:19:02.350
Promise me, you'll protect
Miss Ruri with your life.

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:08.600
My son, you can... do it.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.690
Father?

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.530
Father! Father!

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:40.680
It was at that moment,
something happened to Aoi.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.800
I still don't know
exactly what that was.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:53.400
As Doctor Kenmi put it, the extreme situation
activated the power of the Sacred

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.110
and she tried to protect herself.

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:59.570
So, she turned herself into a stone?

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:00.740
Most likely.

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:06.950
He also told me external forces can't
transform Aoi back to her original self.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:11.540
But, I will save Aoi, no matter what.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:16.590
That's why I kept Aiba Foundation going and
started my battle against the Dark Stones.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:21.090
If Aoi became a stone
due to her fear of the Dark Stones,

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:25.430
I will destroy every Dark Stone
that threatens her.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:30.480
When that happens,
Aoi will come back. Some day.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:37.780
If Aoi were in my position, she'd keep fighting
to defeat the Dark Stones.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.490
That's why, I can't lose.

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:44.780
For Aoi, I have to.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.160
I'm sure she'll come back.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.950
She was the same
for five years, right?

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:53.620
But now she's changed.
It's because we've been fighting.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.790
Yes.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:58.210
That's why she can be saved. I can...

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.720
I can help.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.220
Yes.

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:16.860
Must be nice.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:18.650
What do you want?

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:22.490
You and Ruri Aiba,
both of you are being used.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:27.990
By cowardly, weak humans,
unable to fight for themselves.

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.870
Free yourself, Alma Tandoji.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:35.040
Sacrificing yourself for another,
for a few kind words.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.710
And for a bit of their appreciation.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.960
Is that what you call living?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:45.550
It's not that I want to be appreciated.
It's just that, I felt happy.

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:50.680
This power that could only destroy,
I was able to use it to help someone.

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:52.180
I was able to protect them.

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:54.810
That's what made me happy.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:57.730
I was able to accept myself.

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:00.900
There's a purpose for my power.

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:06.280
You're naive.

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.200
Naito, come join us.

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:13.540
We have the same powers.
That makes you one of us--

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:17.630
I'm... I'm going to kill Kenmi.

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:21.050
The world isn't as simple
as you think.

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:24.800
Although we have the same powers,

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:27.010
we each have a different purpose.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.720
Doctor Kenmi,
preparations are complete.

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:37.310
I'm going to use every drop
of life you have.

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:43.980
To get my hands on that raw stone.
